1
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,040
早安
Good morning!

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,980
寿星驾到
There's the birthday boy!

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,940
蛋糕上插满了65根蜡烛
65 candles on one cake.

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,800
今天可是你的大日子
This is a big day for you...

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,820
以及那些从太空都能看到蜡烛的宇航员们
and for the astronauts who can see it from space.

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,760
生日快乐
Happy birthday to you.

7
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:16,280
谢了 你们知道 我就想安静地过一天
Thank you. And just so everyone knows, I want a quiet day.

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,270
别给我惊喜
No surprises.

9
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,600
不要惊喜
No surprises.

10
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,600
昨晚 我发现我怀孕了
Last night, I found out that I am pregnant,

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,200
所以有个大惊喜正等着杰呢
so Jay's gonna get one big surprise.

12
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,080
好吧 两个惊喜
Okay, two

13
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,980
如果印着比基尼的烧烤围裙也算上的话
if you count the barbecue apron with the bikini body on it.

14
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,460
也不能怪你 杰
I don't blame you, Jay.

15
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,980
你这辈子体验过够多的惊喜了
You'd had enough excitement in one lifetime--

16
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:37,040
飞机的诞生 印刷术的发明 农业的出现
The dawn of flight, printed books, agriculture.

17
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,340
这些玩笑是什么意思
All right, what's with all the jokes?

18
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,665
这叫做吐槽
It's insult comedy.

19
00:00:39,665 --> 00:00:42,075
我上网看了迪安·马丁吐槽大会
I've been watching old Dean Martin roasts online.

20
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,340
忘了这老兄不懂什么是网
Like this guy knows from the internet.

21
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,240
有天早上
The other morning,

22
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,140
我看到他在找汽车的手摇启动把呢
I saw him looking for the crank on the front of his car.

23
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,360
-够了 别说了 -我只想逗大家一乐而已
- Okay, you're done. - I make fun, and we laugh.

24
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,640
不过说真的
But in all seriousness,

25
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:53,340
要是你今天见到一道亮光 千万别走过去
if you see a light today, don't walk towards it.

26
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:57,320
抱歉 昨晚你回家时我已经睡着了
I'm sorry I was asleep when you got home.

27
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,560
小卡和米奇一定很失望
Cam and Mitch must be disappointed.

28
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:02,160
他们为了领养那孩子 下了不少工夫
They were really geared up to get that kid.

29
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,880
但凡事也都有积极的一面嘛
But there's a silver lining.

30
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,500
你说得对 养婴儿麻烦可多了
You might be right. Babies are a lot of work.

31
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,940
不 我不是那个意思
No, that's not what I mean.

32
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:10,140
-我是 -再说他们也不年轻了
- I'm-- - Ah, you know, and these two aren't getting any younger.

33
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:12,480
那种年纪可不要再重新开始
The last thing they need is to start over.

34
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,700
真有那么糟糕吗
Would that be so bad?

35
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:16,620
你好啊 杰
Hey, Jay.

36
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:18,580
你们来干嘛
What are you doing?

37
00:01:19,181 --> 00:01:21,020
-那是什么玩意 -什么
- What the heck is that? - What?

38
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:21,900
上
Get him!

39
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,450
关于他的65岁寿辰
Jay has been very explicit

40
00:01:24,450 --> 00:01:27,550
杰清楚明白地表达过他的愿望
about what he wants to do for his 65th birthday,

41
00:01:29,330 --> 00:01:31,530
但菲尔·邓菲善于读懂他暗含的意思
but Phil Dunphy reads between the lines.

42
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:34,370
你们干什么 搞什么飞机
What the hell is going on?! What are you doing?!

43
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:35,930
你的生日愿望就要成真了
Making your birthday dreams comes true.

44
00:01:35,930 --> 00:01:37,490
今天是你的好日子哦 老弟
It's your special day, buddy.

45
00:01:37,490 --> 00:01:38,410
该把他关在后备箱里吗
Should we put him in the trunk？

46
00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:39,590
把他关在后备箱干什么
Why would we put him in the trunk?

47
00:01:39,610 --> 00:01:40,830
你不是说怎么玩都不为过吗
You said there were no bad ideas.

48
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:42,350
把这蠢玩意取下来
Get this stupid thing off me!

49
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:43,850
你说头套能让他平静下来的
I thought you said the hood would calm him down.

50
00:01:43,930 --> 00:01:45,070
这招对我的猎鹰就管用
It works with my falcon.

51
00:01:45,730 --> 00:01:48,330
别担心 歌洛莉亚 晚餐时间就送他回来
Don't worry, Gloria. We'll have him back in time for dinner.

52
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:50,454
对他来说 那就是下午4点了
Which for him is at 4:00 in the afternoon.

53
00:01:50,745 --> 00:01:52,180
因为他是老人家 真好笑
'Cause he's old! I love it!

54
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:07,290
这咖啡真不错
This is really good coffee.

55
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:08,550
的确如此
It really is.

56
00:02:08,764 --> 00:02:10,526
这是中度烘焙还是
Ahh. Is it a medium roast or...

57
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:11,697
深度烘培
Uh, dark.

58
00:02:12,268 --> 00:02:14,345
我想说深度 话到嘴边怎么成了中度
Oh. I was gonna say dark. I don't know why I said medium.

59
00:02:14,345 --> 00:02:15,537
你本来肯定可以说对的
Well, you would've been right.

60
00:02:18,806 --> 00:02:19,672
加的是全脂牛奶还是
Is it whole milk or...

61
00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:25,290
够了 这太荒唐了
Okay. This is ridiculous.

62
00:02:25,410 --> 00:02:27,130
我们得谈谈客厅里的那只大象了
We need to talk about the elephant in the room.

63
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:31,490
这只巨型填充大象
The giant stuffed elephant

64
00:02:31,490 --> 00:02:33,130
是我们的好基友胡娇送的礼物
was a gift from our good friend Pepper.

65
00:02:33,236 --> 00:02:36,430
同志家庭养小孩算是新鲜事
Gay guys having kids is-- it's relatively new,

66
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:38,150
所以基友们不太懂得
so our community has not yet learned

67
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,570
该送婴儿什么礼物
how to modulate baby gifts.

68
00:02:39,570 --> 00:02:41,830
当斯蒂芬和斯特凡的罗可出生时
When Steven and Stefan had little Rocco,

69
00:02:41,830 --> 00:02:43,170
基友朗吉娜请来了
our friend Longinus sent over

70
00:02:43,170 --> 00:02:44,590
嘎巴宝宝节目的全体演员
the whole cast of "Yo gabba gabba".

71
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:46,750
如今罗可一见鲜亮的颜色就哭
Now Rocco cries whenever he sees bright colors.

72
00:02:46,830 --> 00:02:47,790
我都不能去他家了
I'm not allowed over there.

73
00:02:48,830 --> 00:02:50,850
我看我们还是把它捐给谁吧
I guess we should donate it somewhere,

74
00:02:51,450 --> 00:02:53,030
顺便把那千斤重的大猩猩也捐了
along with the 800-pound gorilla.

75
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:57,330
既然我们不准备领养宝宝了
I mean, you know, now that we're not getting a baby.

76
00:02:57,790 --> 00:02:58,690
顺便一提 这个决定
A decision, by the way,

77
00:02:58,770 --> 00:03:00,630
天亮以后更显得无比英明
which seems even better in the light of day.

78
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:02,109
我也这么觉得
Mm. No, I totally agree.

79
00:03:02,450 --> 00:03:04,230
-我们没事了 -根本是好极了
- So we're good? - No, we're great.

80
00:03:04,250 --> 00:03:05,790
-这事解决得太完美了 -没错
- We couldn't have handled this any better. - No.

81
00:03:06,010 --> 00:03:07,750
我的新弟弟呢
Where's my new baby brother?

82
00:03:09,248 --> 00:03:11,290
好吧 还忘了这个小家伙
Okay. Uh, slight oversight.

83
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:13,110
我想看看他 能给他取名拉里吗
Can I see him? Can we name him Larry?

84
00:03:13,450 --> 00:03:15,510
宝贝 过来坐在爸爸们中间
Okay, sweetie. Here, have a seat with us.

85
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:16,450
听我说
Um, listen.

86
00:03:17,170 --> 00:03:18,950
有件事我们必须告诉你
There's something we need to tell you.

87
00:03:19,110 --> 00:03:20,390
是关于拉里的吗
Is it about Larry?

88
00:03:20,390 --> 00:03:22,790
那个 算是吧
Well, uh, yes. Uh, sort of.

89
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:25,710
事实上 我们无法领养一个新宝宝
Um, it--it turns out that... We're not getting a baby.

90
00:03:25,930 --> 00:03:29,230
我知道你因此而难过
Yeah, and I know this-- this makes you very sad,

91
00:03:29,550 --> 00:03:31,230
但我保证我们家还是
but I promise you we're still a family--

92
00:03:31,250 --> 00:03:31,910
我能养只猫吗
Can I have a kitten?

93
00:03:32,610 --> 00:03:33,250
猫
A kitten?

94
00:03:33,390 --> 00:03:34,910
如果没有新弟弟
If I can't have a brother,

95
00:03:35,130 --> 00:03:37,550
那我就要养只叫拉里的猫
then I want a kitten named Larry.

96
00:03:39,012 --> 00:03:41,790
怎么回事 拉里是哪个动画片中的人物吗
Okay, w-what's this about? Is Larry on a show?

97
00:03:41,790 --> 00:03:44,430
没有 所以才特别诡异
He's not, which is what's weird.

98
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:49,550
-舞会玩得开心吗 -特别开心
- Ooh! How was prom? - So fun.

99
00:03:49,550 --> 00:03:51,190
迈克和我跳了一整晚
Michael and I danced all night...

100
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:52,430
然后我们留下帮忙打扫会场
And then we stayed after and helped clean up,

101
00:03:52,450 --> 00:03:53,190
那也是件大好事
which was awesome

102
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:55,708
因为我见到了下学期教三角学的老师
because I got to meet next year's trig teacher.

103
00:03:55,981 --> 00:03:57,630
我记忆中的舞会可不是这样的
That is not the prom I remember.

104
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:59,410
我头痛死了
I have such a bad headache!

105
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:01,370
这才是我记忆中的舞会
That's the prom I remember.

106
00:04:01,370 --> 00:04:02,150
你喝酒了吗
Were you drinking?

107
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:04,370
妈 你非得又跟我来这一套吗
Mom, do we really have to do this?

108
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:06,670
你问我喝酒了吗 我坚决否认
You ask if I was drinking, I say "No,"

109
00:04:06,670 --> 00:04:08,470
可你我都知道那不是真的
and we both know that that's not true.

110
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:11,730
我们不是早就玩腻这一套了吗
I mean, aren't we past this point in our relationship?

111
00:04:11,950 --> 00:04:13,410
才怪 小姑娘 我们才没有
No, young lady, we are not.

112
00:04:13,570 --> 00:04:14,450
那我就没喝酒
Then I wasn't drinking.

113
00:04:15,850 --> 00:04:17,230
我也没喝 邓夫人
Me neither, mrs. D.

114
00:04:17,790 --> 00:04:20,390
我的天 别告诉我他在家里过夜了
Dear God. Tell me he did not spend the night here.

115
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:22,670
妈 你非要又跟我来这一套吗
Mom, do we really have to do this?

116
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,750
妈 我需要做出一个重大决定
Mom, I have a big decision to make

117
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:28,030
是关于今年的诗歌夏令营的
about poetry camp this summer.

118
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:30,090
又是关于要带哪根手杖吗
Is this about the walking sticks again?

119
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:32,170
全带上 等你到了那儿再决定用哪根吧
Pack them all and decide when you're there.

120
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:34,290
我可以主攻十四行诗和自由诗体
I can either focus on sonnets or free verse.

121
00:04:34,790 --> 00:04:36,830
我一直自诩为十四行诗大师
I've always fancied myself a sonneteer,

122
00:04:36,870 --> 00:04:38,810
但我在想 那些推崇自由诗体的女孩
But I'm thinking the free verse girls

123
00:04:38,810 --> 00:04:40,230
在那方面应该也很"自由"
will be freer with everything,

124
00:04:40,392 --> 00:04:41,630
你懂我的意思吧
If you catch my meaning.

125
00:04:43,741 --> 00:04:45,090
对不起 曼尼
Hmm? Ay. I'm sorry, Manny.

126
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:47,070
我相信你一定能做出正确的决定
I'm sure you will make the right decision.

127
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:49,070
你没事吧 你似乎心不在焉的
Are you okay? You seem distracted.

128
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:51,890
曼尼 快坐下 我得告诉你一些事
Manny, sit down. I have to tell you something.

129
00:04:52,810 --> 00:04:53,170
什么
What?

130
00:04:54,890 --> 00:04:56,290
我怀孕了
I am pregnant.

131
00:04:57,470 --> 00:04:58,210
你什么
You're what?

132
00:04:58,430 --> 00:04:59,750
我又要当妈了
I'm going to have a baby.

133
00:05:00,970 --> 00:05:01,450
哇
Wow.

134
00:05:02,050 --> 00:05:02,530
怎么
What?

135
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,070
你不开心吗
You're not happy?

136
00:05:04,330 --> 00:05:05,290
开心 当然开心
Yeah. Sure.

137
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,170
只是消息太猛 一时难以接受
It's just a lot to take in.

138
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:10,210
老实说 新生命来的真不是好时候
And I'll be honest, this isn't coming at a great time for me,

139
00:05:10,210 --> 00:05:11,590
我现在有一大堆事要忙
With everything I've got going on.

140
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:13,630
照顾孩子又不是你的责任
This is not your responsibility.

141
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:15,270
家里的木制沙拉碗也不是我的责任啊
Neither is our wooden salad bowl,

142
00:05:15,530 --> 00:05:16,710
但只有我给它涂油
But I'm the only one who oils it.

143
00:05:16,970 --> 00:05:19,190
没有我 那木碗会像海绵一样吸光沙拉料
Without me, that thing would soak up dressing like a sponge.

144
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:21,099
曼尼 我可以照顾好宝宝的
Manny, I can take care of a baby.

145
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:22,250
我成功地把你照顾长大
I took care of you.

146
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:24,670
拜托 我是个奇才 我自学的怎么用便壶
Please. I was an anomaly. I self-potty trained.

147
00:05:25,410 --> 00:05:27,110
当年幼小的我就是不明白
I just did not get the appeal

148
00:05:27,110 --> 00:05:28,990
为什么要故意把屎尿拉在裤子上呢
of intentionally soiling one's pants.

149
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:30,570
然而鉴于此
That said,

150
00:05:30,730 --> 00:05:32,810
我也承认很怀念妈妈在我小肚子上的亲亲
I will admit to missing the kisses on my tummy.

151
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:35,050
杰是什么反应
How did Jay take it?

152
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:37,650
我还没有告诉他
I haven't been able to tell him yet.

153
00:05:38,010 --> 00:05:39,210
他可能不会太欣喜
He might not be too thrilled.

154
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:42,930
你这么想吗 我也开始这么想了
Do you think? I was starting to wonder the same thing.

155
00:05:43,010 --> 00:05:44,470
他不喜欢接受改变
He doesn't deal well with change.

156
00:05:44,610 --> 00:05:45,330
我知道
I know.

157
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:48,370
他现在还每天都在前门查看晚报到了没有
He still checks the front step for the evening paper.

158
00:05:48,550 --> 00:05:50,630
别担心 妈 我相信他会适应的
Don't worry, mom. I'm sure he'll adapt.

159
00:05:51,470 --> 00:05:54,210
尽管 他现在还把遥控器叫做"敲控器"
Although, he still does call the remote the "Clicker."

160
00:05:54,899 --> 00:05:56,319
是啊
Ay, yeah.

161
00:06:00,690 --> 00:06:03,390
我好无聊 爹地 让汽车跳舞吧
I'm bored, daddy. Make the car dance.

162
00:06:03,490 --> 00:06:05,290
好吧 但只能跳一会儿 好吗
All right. But just for a second, all right?

163
00:06:09,210 --> 00:06:10,950
再来一次
Do it again.

164
00:06:11,250 --> 00:06:12,350
不 一次就够了
No. Once was enough.

165
00:06:12,930 --> 00:06:17,270
如果我不能有个弟弟 那我就要汽车跳舞
If I can't have a brother, then I want the car to dance.

166
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:20,121
你还真会一次又一次地用这招啊
Wow, you are really comfortable playing that card.

167
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:25,114
他们不收
They wouldn't take 'em.

168
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:29,410
他们害怕这些东西身上有臭虫
They were afraid they might have bedbugs.

169
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:32,170
开什么玩笑 他们拒绝了我们的捐赠吗
Are you serious? They rejected our donation?

170
00:06:32,210 --> 00:06:32,990
我深感被冒犯
I was so offended,

171
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:35,078
差点没买这个小奶油壶
I almost didn't buy this fiestaware creamer.

172
00:06:35,078 --> 00:06:35,950
只要2块哦
2 bucks.

173
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:36,830
之前还不知道他们有这好东西呢
Didn't know what they had.

174
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:39,004
哈 扳回一分
Ah! Score.

175
00:06:39,547 --> 00:06:41,591
我们接下来要干什么
So what are we gonna do now?

176
00:06:41,591 --> 00:06:44,610
弄只猫 然后给它取名拉里
Get a kitten and then name it Larry.

177
00:06:44,610 --> 00:06:47,030
莉莉 亲爱的 现在养猫不合适
Lily, honey, this is hardly the day to get a kitten, okay?

178
00:06:47,030 --> 00:06:48,070
你能跟她说说吗
Would you just tell her?

179
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:48,970
我不知道
I don't know.

180
00:06:49,741 --> 00:06:51,242
我现在也想弄一只
I kinda want one now.

181
00:06:51,790 --> 00:06:53,410
我们经历了太多的不愉快
You know, we have been through a lot,

182
00:06:53,410 --> 00:06:57,170
或许领回家一只有爱的小宠物
And maybe the presence of a cuddly little friend

183
00:06:57,170 --> 00:06:58,570
能帮助我们愈合心中的伤口
will help us ease the pain.

184
00:06:59,150 --> 00:07:00,810
好吧 你的意思是说
Okay, so what you're saying is,

185
00:07:00,810 --> 00:07:02,470
你心中有个婴儿形状的伤口
You have a child-shaped hole in your heart,

186
00:07:02,470 --> 00:07:05,130
你打算用一只猫去堵住那伤口吗
And your plan is to cram a cat into there?

187
00:07:06,401 --> 00:07:07,563
他是有名字的
He has a name.

188
00:07:09,450 --> 00:07:11,770
我等不及看到你的眼睛重见光明时
I can't wait till your eyes adjust to the light,

189
00:07:11,770 --> 00:07:13,290
你脸上那惊喜的表情
and we see the look on your face.

190
00:07:13,470 --> 00:07:14,310
我恨你们
I hate you guys.

191
00:07:14,810 --> 00:07:16,730
嘿 菲尔 你想过要留胡子吗
Hey, Phil, you ever think about growing a beard?

192
00:07:17,090 --> 00:07:18,310
我是说 你的脸型很适合的
I mean, you got the face for it.

193
00:07:18,530 --> 00:07:19,410
-你那样觉得吗 -是啊
- You think? - Yeah.

194
00:07:19,490 --> 00:07:21,150
有意思 我也一直想留 但我老婆不喜欢
That's funny. I always thought so, but my wife doesn't.

195
00:07:21,530 --> 00:07:22,290
她知道个什么啊
Oh, what does she know?

196
00:07:22,290 --> 00:07:24,610
瞧瞧 你鼻子那么有型 眼睛又那么深邃
Come on, you got a great nose, those deep-set eyes.

197
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:25,830
我是说 你留胡子一定超帅的
I mean, you would look good.

198
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:27,386
谢谢你 小短
Thanks, Shorty.

199
00:07:27,610 --> 00:07:30,530
有点像乔·哈姆在戏外的造型
It's, uh, sort of a Jon Hamm in between projects.

200
00:07:30,650 --> 00:07:31,910
好了 把我放回车厢里吧
Okay, put me back in the trunk.

201
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:33,030
放松 你就快到了
Relax, you're almost there.

202
00:07:33,030 --> 00:07:33,810
不 我不干了
Nope, I'm done now!

203
00:07:33,810 --> 00:07:35,804
-嘿 杰 -不 不 不
- Hey, jay, no! - No! No! No! Hey!

204
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:37,390
杰 杰
Jay! Jay!

205
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:39,731
-杰 -狗娘养的
- Jay! - Son of a bitch!

206
00:07:39,810 --> 00:07:40,690
快来个人救我
Somebody help me!

207
00:07:40,832 --> 00:07:43,250
我也想啊 但我的裤子是山羊绒的
I would, but--but these pants are cashmere!

208
00:07:43,250 --> 00:07:44,150
我来救你 杰
I got you, Jay!

209
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:47,290
你得让他冷静下来
You gotta calm him down!

210
00:07:47,690 --> 00:07:49,850
-打他的头 -别打他的头
- Punch him in the head! - Don't punch him in the head!

211
00:07:49,890 --> 00:07:52,530
别逼我打晕你 我会为了救你打晕你的
Don't make me punch you! I will punch you to save you!

212
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:53,770
我觉得我像是在被施水刑一样
I think I'm being waterboarded.

213
00:07:53,770 --> 00:07:54,930
是你逼我的
You're making me do this!

214
00:07:56,730 --> 00:07:58,070
把这玩意儿拿下来
Get this thing off me!

215
00:08:00,169 --> 00:08:01,343
生日快乐
Happy birthday.

216
00:08:01,681 --> 00:08:02,964
我们是打算带你钓鱼的
We're taking you fishing.

217
00:08:07,650 --> 00:08:08,830
不管怎么说
For whatever it's worth,

218
00:08:08,930 --> 00:08:10,770
迪兰昨晚非常表现得极具责任感
Dylan was very responsible last night.

219
00:08:11,030 --> 00:08:12,550
家里能有他真好
He's a good guy to have around the house.

220
00:08:12,550 --> 00:08:14,730
你到底想说什么
Mm. Where we going with this?

221
00:08:14,730 --> 00:08:16,870
既然我不能搬去和他一起住
Well, since I can't move in with him anymore,

222
00:08:16,930 --> 00:08:18,490
他负担不起他的房租钱
He can't afford his apartment.

223
00:08:18,490 --> 00:08:21,490
所以我在想能不能
So I was wondering if it would be okay

224
00:08:21,490 --> 00:08:24,050
让他和我们一起住几个星期
if he could stay with us for a couple weeks?

225
00:08:24,330 --> 00:08:25,790
当然可以 不如
Sure. Oh, you know what?

226
00:08:25,790 --> 00:08:27,110
把我们的大房间让给你们吧
Why don't you guys take our room?

227
00:08:29,930 --> 00:08:31,290
她那是戏谑的说法
She's being facetious.

228
00:08:32,830 --> 00:08:33,390
就是讽刺
Sarcastic.

229
00:08:34,750 --> 00:08:35,690
迪兰不能搬进来
Dylan no stay.

230
00:08:36,010 --> 00:08:36,550
什么
what?!

231
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:38,268
拜托 他能帮许多忙
Oh, come on! He helps out a lot.

232
00:08:38,268 --> 00:08:39,668
他手可巧了
He is very handy.

233
00:08:40,210 --> 00:08:43,110
是吗 他不是曾把自己反锁在车里吗
Really? The guy who locked himself in his car?

234
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:46,250
你没资格开口向我求情 小姐
You are in no position to be asking for favors, young lady.

235
00:08:46,370 --> 00:08:48,250
来 把这个喝了 解酒的
Here. Drink this. It's for your hangover.

236
00:08:49,542 --> 00:08:50,870
闻着太恶心了
Ugh. It smells gross.

237
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,350
那你就快点儿喝嘛
Well, then you better drink it fast.

238
00:08:57,368 --> 00:08:59,564
恶 我要吐了
Ew! I'm gonna throw up! Ugh! Ugh!

239
00:09:02,970 --> 00:09:03,970
那是解酒的吗
That's a hangover cure?

240
00:09:04,770 --> 00:09:05,250
不是
No.

241
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:08,050
我这手机应该是短路了
Well, this is probably shot.

242
00:09:09,210 --> 00:09:11,770
我得再跟你说声对不起 不该打你头
Once again, I'd like to apologize for punching you in the head.

243
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:14,230
可是只有这样才能救你
It really was the only way to save you

244
00:09:14,230 --> 00:09:16,750
你当时双手被绑着 头也被 罩着
since you were bound and... hooded,

245
00:09:16,810 --> 00:09:18,430
我还得再为这个道个歉
which leads me to my second apology.

246
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:20,850
先生们 得了 就像我叔叔常说的
Gentlemen, come on. As my uncle used to say,

247
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:23,810
别让一次搞砸了的绑架毁了整个午后时光
let's not let a botched kidnapping ruin our whole afternoon.

248
00:09:23,930 --> 00:09:26,030
他说的对 这件事的重点在于
He's right. The whole point of this

249
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:28,870
让你和三个最好的朋友享受湖上风光
is for you to enjoy the lake with your three best friends.

250
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,651
斯坦来了吗
Stan coming?

251
00:09:31,370 --> 00:09:31,810
好受伤
Burn!

252
00:09:33,590 --> 00:09:35,250
65岁了哈
So... 65, huh?

253
00:09:35,610 --> 00:09:38,090
你即将迎来人生中最美好的日子
You're heading into the best years of your life.

254
00:09:38,110 --> 00:09:38,630
说的对
That's right.

255
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:40,450
你兢兢业业工作过 该爬的山也都爬了
You put in the work. You climbed the mountain.

256
00:09:40,450 --> 00:09:42,470
现在是接受奖赏的时刻了
Now it's time to reap the rewards.

257
00:09:42,610 --> 00:09:43,310
我想你是对的
I guess you're right.

258
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,510
我觉得相当美好啊
Sounds pretty good to me.

259
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:46,010
你知道吗 我越看你
You know, the more I look at you,

260
00:09:46,090 --> 00:09:47,910
就越气愤你咋不留胡子呢
the angrier I get that you don't got a beard.

261
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:49,210
我留过灵魂补丁款的[下唇留小撮胡子]
I had a soul patch once.

262
00:09:49,210 --> 00:09:51,987
灵魂补丁 那是胡子界的耻辱
A soul patch? That's like a beard's crap.

263
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:54,610
我上周打了6次高尔夫
I golfed six times last week.

264
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:56,830
找到了42颗球 创下新纪录了
found 42 balls-- a new record.

265
00:09:56,990 --> 00:09:58,610
我觉得我的猎鹰肯定找不到那么多
I don't think my falcon could have found that many,

266
00:09:58,610 --> 00:10:01,070
不过它能发现600码开外的老鼠
And he can spot a mouse at 600 yards.

267
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,850
这和胡子有一毛钱关系吗
Whats that have to do with beards?

268
00:10:02,850 --> 00:10:04,590
我们不是在探讨杰已经65岁
I thought we were talking about Jay turning 65

269
00:10:04,590 --> 00:10:05,930
而65岁有多棒的话题吗
and how good that's gonna be.

270
00:10:06,010 --> 00:10:07,470
对啊 这岁数好啊 杰
That's right. It's gonna be great, jay.

271
00:10:07,470 --> 00:10:09,930
我跟你说 我开垦了一片菜地
I'm telling ya. I got a vegetable garden.

272
00:10:09,930 --> 00:10:12,330
两年前 那就是我院子里的一个泥坑
Two years ago, it was a patch of dirt in my backyard.

273
00:10:12,610 --> 00:10:15,270
现在我种上了西红柿 五种豆豆
Now I got tomatoes, I got five kinds of beans,

274
00:10:15,430 --> 00:10:16,410
还有南瓜
I got squash.

275
00:10:16,650 --> 00:10:17,750
我只告诉你
And between you and me,

276
00:10:18,190 --> 00:10:20,270
我都开始考虑自己腌制酸黄瓜了
I'm even thinking about pickling my own cucumbers.

277
00:10:20,410 --> 00:10:21,970
为啥这个只对我说
Why would that be between you and me?

278
00:10:21,970 --> 00:10:24,750
因为腌菜数量有限呐
Because there's a finite number of pickles.

279
00:10:25,170 --> 00:10:26,850
别担心 你俩也有份
But don't worry. All you guys are on the list.

280
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,650
我想来祝个词
Well, I'd like to make a toast.

281
00:10:29,410 --> 00:10:31,870
敬杰 虽然你已经没啥潜力了
To Jay, who's not particularly buoyant.

282
00:10:31,910 --> 00:10:33,430
再次地 我对此深表遗憾
And again, I'm very sorry about that.

283
00:10:33,430 --> 00:10:35,830
但他是世上难寻的绝佳岳父
But he's the best father-in-law a guy could ask for.

284
00:10:35,830 --> 00:10:39,010
我们能够认识他 都非常幸运 干杯
All right. And we're--we're all really lucky to know him. Cheers.

285
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:39,950
-来 来吧 -祝你健康
- Here, here. - Salud.

286
00:10:40,710 --> 00:10:41,830
谢谢伙计们 你们知道吗
Thanks, guys. You know what?

287
00:10:41,830 --> 00:10:43,980
和你们一起出来非常开心
It is kinda nice being out here with all of ya.

288
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:45,130
我们钓鱼吧
Hey, let's do some fishing.

289
00:10:45,410 --> 00:10:47,790
我感觉好多了 身上总算快干了
I'm starting to feel better now that I'm finally getting dry.

290
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:49,550
钓鱼吧
Let's do this!

291
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:50,581
-走吧 -好的
- Let's go! - All right!

292
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:57,790
当然
Sure.

293
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:58,199
你知道吗
You know,

294
00:10:58,199 --> 00:11:00,232
我在毕业舞会上喝了一点儿薄荷杜松子酒
I had a little peppermints schnapps at my prom,

295
00:11:00,232 --> 00:11:01,790
但我瞒过了我的父母
but I hid it from my parents

296
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:04,170
而且在他们起床前 把我男友弄出了门
and I kicked my boyfriend out before they woke up.

297
00:11:04,370 --> 00:11:05,490
那叫做起码的尊重
It's called respect.

298
00:11:07,510 --> 00:11:08,250
我怀孕了
I'm pregnant.

299
00:11:09,530 --> 00:11:10,970
你要变肥了
You're gonna get fat.

300
00:11:11,806 --> 00:11:13,299
你 我是说
You--oh! I mean...

301
00:11:13,405 --> 00:11:15,607
太好了 太好了 你怀孕了
That's great. It's great! You're pregnant!

302
00:11:15,607 --> 00:11:17,237
棒极了 恭喜你
It's great! Congratulations!

303
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:20,070
其实是个意外之喜
It was a surprise.

304
00:11:20,350 --> 00:11:22,130
可不是嘛 我爸爸怎么说
Yeah, I'll bet. What did my dad say?

305
00:11:22,210 --> 00:11:23,570
我还没有告诉他
I haven't told him yet.

306
00:11:23,730 --> 00:11:26,850
我担心他会觉得这个不是个好消息
I worry that he's going to think it's not such great news.

307
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:29,790
不会的 别傻了
Ohh, no. Don't be silly.

308
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:30,750
他会高兴死的
He's gonna be thrilled.

309
00:11:32,110 --> 00:11:34,070
我知道他才不会高兴呢
I knew he wasn't gonna be thrilled.

310
00:11:34,070 --> 00:11:36,350
如果历史可以为鉴
And if history was any indication,

311
00:11:36,830 --> 00:11:38,490
他也不会掩盖自己情绪的
he wasn't gonna be able to hide it.

312
00:11:38,890 --> 00:11:41,890
这是一款法式加拿大美味 叫做布丁
It's a french canadian delicacy called poutine.

313
00:11:41,890 --> 00:11:42,981
看着像是别人吐出来的
Mm. Well, it looks like vomit,

314
00:11:42,981 --> 00:11:45,619
我才不会让那东西"补丁"进我嘴里
So I'm not pou-ting it in my mouth.

315
00:11:49,170 --> 00:11:49,990
我们来了
We're here!

316
00:11:52,450 --> 00:11:53,490
你头发怎么了
What'd you do to your hair?

317
00:11:53,490 --> 00:11:55,170
我想尝试一下新发型
I thought I'd try something different.

318
00:11:55,170 --> 00:11:55,950
干嘛 为了显老吗
What, looking old?

319
00:11:59,070 --> 00:12:00,450
我得赶在老爸
I had to get to dad

320
00:12:00,450 --> 00:12:02,750
对歌洛莉亚说出刻薄话前找到他
Before he said something insensitive to Gloria.

321
00:12:04,238 --> 00:12:06,593
但她肯定会变得很肥的
But she is gonna get really fat, though.

322
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:10,530
爸 给我回电话
Dad, call me back.

323
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:12,250
我有很重要的事要告诉你
I have something very important to tell you

324
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:14,010
那样你回家后就不会说些蠢话
So when you get home you don't say something stupid

325
00:12:14,010 --> 00:12:14,890
就像你以前常干的那样
Like you usually do.

326
00:12:15,310 --> 00:12:16,290
噢 生日快乐
oh, happy birthday.

327
00:12:17,564 --> 00:12:19,790
我不得不说
Yeah. I've gotta say,

328
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:22,650
你对新宝宝一事的反应 比我想的要淡定的多
You're handling this baby thing better than I would've expected.

329
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:23,510
你什么意思
What do you mean?

330
00:12:23,650 --> 00:12:25,490
你已经习惯了当家里唯一的孩子
You're used to being the only kid in the house.

331
00:12:25,810 --> 00:12:28,650
马上就会多个新的孩子 杰的亲生孩子
Now there's gonna be a new kid. Jay's kid.

332
00:12:28,990 --> 00:12:29,430
那又如何
So?

333
00:12:29,430 --> 00:12:31,356
以前的曼尼肯定会担心
Well, the old Manny would've been worried

334
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:33,150
杰会更疼爱新出生的孩子
that Jay would love the new kid more.

335
00:12:33,450 --> 00:12:35,790
我觉得你太低估我的可爱乖巧了
I think you're underestimating how adorable I am.

336
00:12:35,950 --> 00:12:38,150
你说得对 你可比小宝宝萌多了
You're right. You're way cuter than a baby.

337
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:40,030
我去看看晚饭好了没有
I'm gonna go check on dinner.

338
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:46,190
有时候我就喜欢扔个炸弹 然后走开
Sometimes I just like to toss a grenade and run away.

339
00:12:47,430 --> 00:12:48,450
来 吸一口气
All right, take a whiff.

340
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:49,510
确定你喜欢这味道哦
Make sure you like it,

341
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,497
因为以后我们家沙发就会是这味儿了
'cause that's what our couch is gonna smell like.

342
00:12:52,010 --> 00:12:53,770
你好 我们就打算要这只了
Okay, hi. Yes, we're gonna take this one.

343
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:55,790
你们先别急着要
Oh, I'm gonna need you to slow down a bit.

344
00:12:55,930 --> 00:12:57,670
我们有一些手续要办
There's a process we need to go through

345
00:12:57,670 --> 00:12:59,370
以确定你们是否有资格养猫
to see if you're a suitable cat guardian.

346
00:12:59,690 --> 00:13:01,130
噢是吗 我以为手续就是
Oh, really? Because I thought the process was,

347
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:02,150
我表示看中了这只
I say, "We'll take this one."

348
00:13:02,150 --> 00:13:04,110
而你感激涕零 因为你们囤猫太多
And then you say, "Thank god because we have too many cats."

349
00:13:04,290 --> 00:13:07,070
不 我们得确保它们都能找到好归宿
No. We need to ensure these cats are going to good homes.

350
00:13:07,190 --> 00:13:08,950
所以你们得先填了这张表
That's why we need you to fill out this form,

351
00:13:08,950 --> 00:13:10,310
然后我们会到你们家实地拜访
And then there'll be a site visit.

352
00:13:10,670 --> 00:13:13,150
是这样 一年来我们饱尝各种辛酸麻烦
Okay, um, we've just been through a very frustrating year

353
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:14,710
就为了领养个孩子 所以
trying to adopt a baby, so...

354
00:13:15,290 --> 00:13:17,130
希望你能体谅我们实在不愿意
You'll forgive us if we're not really in the mood

355
00:13:17,130 --> 00:13:19,070
为一只猫搞得太折腾
to jump through too many hoops for a cat.

356
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:21,170
为什么你们没领养成功
Oh. Why wouldn't they give you a baby?

357
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:22,850
-那问题很复杂 -领养猫也是
- It's complicated. - So are cats.

358
00:13:22,930 --> 00:13:24,570
是吗 那边那只猫一直在舔自己
Are they? 'cause that one over there has been licking

359
00:13:24,570 --> 00:13:25,970
从我们来一直舔到现在
itself ever since we got here.

360
00:13:25,970 --> 00:13:28,686
好吧 我...我弄不下去了
Okay, you know what? I'm--I can't do this.

361
00:13:29,470 --> 00:13:30,730
拉里怎么办
What about Larry?

362
00:13:30,830 --> 00:13:32,190
抱歉 莉莉 今天不行
I'm sorry, Lily. Not today.

363
00:13:34,770 --> 00:13:36,750
米奇尔一走了之 我可不会善罢甘休
Mitchell stormed off, but I couldn't.

364
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:38,710
我得给她点颜色瞧瞧
I had to give her a piece of my mind.

365
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:39,510
结果呢
And how'd that go?

366
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:41,170
我想我可能跑偏了一点点
I may have strayed off topic just a bit.

367
00:13:41,930 --> 00:13:42,690
不可能 大姐
No, sir!

368
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:45,370
不 在我心中她永远是单纯的诺玛·简[梦露原名]
No, she will always be Norma Jeane Baker to me.

369
00:13:45,430 --> 00:13:46,670
你到底想说什么
What is your point, exactly?

370
00:13:46,730 --> 00:13:48,410
就像离过三次婚的女星
That like the thrice-married starlet,

371
00:13:48,690 --> 00:13:51,550
这只猫被剥夺了享受家庭温暖的权利
This cat is being deprived a stable home.

372
00:13:51,590 --> 00:13:52,970
我很抱歉让你不高兴了
I'm sorry if you're upset.

373
00:13:52,970 --> 00:13:55,010
真正该不高兴的人是你才对吧 女士
You're the one who should be upset, ma'am.

374
00:13:55,010 --> 00:13:57,450
我们可是喜欢动物的爱心人士
we are animals lovers.

375
00:13:57,450 --> 00:14:00,410
那只猫原本可以享"受"最完美的呵护
That cat would've been on the receiving end of affection

376
00:14:00,410 --> 00:14:02,150
24小时不间断
24 hours a day.

377
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:06,035
满足它的全部需求将成为我们的首要任务
Satisfying its every need would've been our top priority.

378
00:14:11,570 --> 00:14:13,090
好吧 鉴于这样的画面
Okay, in light of that tableau,

379
00:14:13,170 --> 00:14:14,750
我要收回之前说的让那只猫享"受"
I would like to take back the phrase "Receiving end."

380
00:14:19,110 --> 00:14:21,530
老妈 我决定不参加诗歌夏令营了
Mom, I've decided I'm not going to poetry camp.

381
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:22,630
什么 为什么
What? Why not?

382
00:14:22,630 --> 00:14:23,950
因为等我回来的时候
'cause by the time I come back,

383
00:14:23,950 --> 00:14:25,730
杰会把我的房间变成婴儿房
Jay will have turned my room into a nursery.

384
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:26,470
不 他不会的
No, he won't.

385
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:27,790
我不是他亲生的
I'm not his real kid.

386
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:30,510
我将如狂风中的耳语一般被无视
I'll be as insignificant as a whisper in a windstorm.

387
00:14:30,810 --> 00:14:33,430
瞧你说的 你这么有天赋
Oh, listen to you. You have a gift.

388
00:14:33,690 --> 00:14:35,070
你必须去参加诗歌夏令营
You have to go to the poetry camp.

389
00:14:35,150 --> 00:14:35,730
恐怕我是不会去了
I don't think I can

390
00:14:36,570 --> 00:14:38,950
曼尼拜托 我现在已经够烦心的了
Manny, please. I have too much to worry about right now.

391
00:14:38,950 --> 00:14:39,850
-好吗 -你
-Okay? - You?

392
00:14:40,130 --> 00:14:41,590
我才是自掘坟墓
I dug a pretty big hole for myself

393
00:14:41,590 --> 00:14:43,332
今早说了那么多冒犯他的笑话
with those insult jokes this morning.

394
00:14:43,550 --> 00:14:44,810
为什么我不学学里格斯
Why didn't I learn from Rickles?

395
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:46,530
得在结束时来点摇摆小舞
You gotta end with some ticker.

396
00:14:49,070 --> 00:14:49,970
算了 我认输
Okay, I give up.

397
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:51,690
我实在摆不出一个不淫荡的体位
I can't find a position that's not sexual.

398
00:14:52,210 --> 00:14:54,410
-淡定 -我淡定不了
- Just calm down. - I can't calm down.

399
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:57,090
也许我们没有嘴上说的那么没事
You know, maybe we're not as okay as we keep saying we are.

400
00:14:57,310 --> 00:14:59,770
-我知道 -也许我们该离开一段时间
- I know. - Maybe we should go away.

401
00:15:00,010 --> 00:15:02,310
到一个陌生的地方去疗伤
You know, go someplace to heal.

402
00:15:02,310 --> 00:15:03,320
哪里
Where?

403
00:15:03,379 --> 00:15:05,408
一个拥有华丽剧院的地方
Well, someplace with a vibrant theater scene...

404
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:07,570
处处是高级餐厅
Top-notch restaurants...

405
00:15:08,852 --> 00:15:10,010
密苏里怀特河畔的风水宝地
The jewel of Missouri's white river.

406
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:10,910
我们才不要去布兰森
We're not going to Branson.

407
00:15:11,170 --> 00:15:14,110
好吧 你想去哪里
Okay, fine. Where would you go?

408
00:15:14,410 --> 00:15:16,050
不知道 欧洲如何
I don't know. Maybe europe?

409
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:16,830
伦敦
London?

410
00:15:16,950 --> 00:15:18,810
越远越好
Just somewhere far away.

411
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:22,990
-我好悲伤 小卡 -我也是
-I'm just sad, Cam. - I am, too.

412
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:25,810
我把以后早晨怎么度过都打算好了
You know, I had our mornings all planned out.

413
00:15:27,013 --> 00:15:29,390
我抱着宝宝送莉莉去幼儿园
The baby and I would walk Lily to kindergarten

414
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:30,950
然后穿过公园回家
and then cut back home through the park

415
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:32,690
停下来喂喂鸭子 虽然公园不让喂
and feed those ducks that you're not supposed to feed

416
00:15:32,710 --> 00:15:33,690
但大家都在喂
but everybody does.

417
00:15:34,570 --> 00:15:36,510
我买了相框放在桌上
I bought a picture frame for my desk,

418
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:38,610
它一直在那里静静等待
and it's just sitting there,

419
00:15:39,070 --> 00:15:40,690
他的出现
Waiting for his face.

420
00:15:41,110 --> 00:15:42,370
抱抱
Come here.

421
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:46,430
我感觉好多了
I already feel better.

422
00:15:47,010 --> 00:15:47,110
我也是
Me, too.

423
00:15:47,590 --> 00:15:49,190
瞧瞧拥抱的力量
See what the power of a hug can do?

424
00:15:49,810 --> 00:15:51,550
省了我们长途跋涉的一路颠簸
Just saved us a long plane ride with a toddler.

425
00:15:51,650 --> 00:15:54,190
-也省了搞一只猫回来 -猫还是得有的
- And a cat that we didn't want. - Oh, we're still getting that.

426
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:58,970
瞧 看上去如何
All right, how does this look?

427
00:15:59,570 --> 00:16:01,770
超级纯情 都没有肢体接触
Perfectly innocent. They're not even touching.

428
00:16:02,430 --> 00:16:03,910
很好 走吧
Great. Okay. Let's go.

429
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:04,650
好吧
All right.

430
00:16:05,390 --> 00:16:06,290
坐好了 宝贝
You ready, honey?

431
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:13,104
去吧 去吧
Go. Go.

432
00:16:14,190 --> 00:16:15,490
你好 邓菲太太
Hey, Mrs. Dunphy?

433
00:16:15,490 --> 00:16:18,330
我听说了海莉问你的事 其实我想告诉你
I heard about what Haley asked you, and just so you know,

434
00:16:18,530 --> 00:16:20,710
我不是有意让你为难
I never wanted to put you in that position.

435
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:23,070
-没关系的 -那就好
- I'll be fine. - That's good to know.

436
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:26,810
我表哥迪兰说我可以在他家里住
My cousin Dylan said I could stay at his house.

437
00:16:27,030 --> 00:16:29,270
虽然 其实不是真的家里
Well, not really at his house.

438
00:16:29,270 --> 00:16:31,710
准确的说是...车库
More like behind it... In the garage.

439
00:16:32,010 --> 00:16:32,450
不错啊
Okay.

440
00:16:32,830 --> 00:16:34,270
其实 那里没有墙
Well, actually, there are no walls,

441
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:36,330
所以更准确的说是停车门廊
So it's more of a porte cochere.

442
00:16:36,330 --> 00:16:36,770
挺好嘛
Fancy.

443
00:16:36,970 --> 00:16:38,330
反正 我就在那里睡
Anyway, I'll be sleeping in it.

444
00:16:38,450 --> 00:16:39,430
那里有卫生间的
It's got a bathroom.

445
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:41,590
准确的说 是半间
More of a half-bath.

446
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:43,010
是个咖啡罐
It's a coffee can.

447
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:45,430
总之 我会过得很好
Anyway, I'll be fine

448
00:16:45,430 --> 00:16:47,870
只要能发现一个抵御郊狼袭击的帐篷就行
once I find a nice tent to protect me from the coyotes.

449
00:16:48,070 --> 00:16:50,010
记得把食物挂在高处
Well, be sure to hang your food up high.

450
00:16:50,930 --> 00:16:51,710
我们回来啦
we're back!

451
00:16:53,470 --> 00:16:54,270
寿星驾到
Birthday boy's here!

452
00:16:54,770 --> 00:16:55,970
杰 你浑身都皱皱的
Hey, Jay, you're all wrinkled.

453
00:16:56,090 --> 00:16:57,630
是啊 你想说我人老皮皱
Yeah, yeah, I'm old. I get it.

454
00:16:57,630 --> 00:16:58,730
不 我是指你的衣服
No, I mean your clothes.

455
00:16:58,810 --> 00:17:00,730
像你这么大的时候 我都披兽皮
Yeah, when I was your age, I was wearing animal skins.

456
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:01,630
哗 你戏谑到我了
Bam! You got me.

457
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:03,270
我觉得 哗 你戏谑到你自己了
I think, bam! You got yourself.

458
00:17:03,490 --> 00:17:04,730
我只是表示关心而已
I'm just expressing concern.

459
00:17:04,770 --> 00:17:06,630
让我想想 关心我的骨质密度
Let me guess-- about my bone density.

460
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:07,910
不得不说 你真是个聪明蛋
You know, you're a real smart-ass.

461
00:17:08,246 --> 00:17:10,650
这样下去 我得住地下室了
At this rate, I'll be living in the basement.

462
00:17:10,650 --> 00:17:11,030
真幸运
Lucky.

463
00:17:11,930 --> 00:17:14,450
爸 爸 快点 过来一下
Dad? Dad, okay, quick. Just come here one second.

464
00:17:14,530 --> 00:17:15,090
我有事跟你说
I gotta tell you something.

465
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:20,070
有人会告诉你一件非常重要的事情
Somebody is about to tell you some very important news.

466
00:17:20,210 --> 00:17:21,770
这辈子第一次
And for the first time in your life,

467
00:17:21,830 --> 00:17:23,270
请你说些好听的话
I need you to react nicely.

468
00:17:23,490 --> 00:17:25,890
-我总是捡好听的说 -从没有过
- I always react nicely. - You never do.

469
00:17:25,930 --> 00:17:29,030
我说的那个人现在非常脆弱无助
And this person in question is very vulnerable right now.

470
00:17:29,150 --> 00:17:31,430
所以求你一定要表现出关爱与支持
So could you please just be loving and supportive?

471
00:17:31,430 --> 00:17:34,498
-生日快乐 老爸 -谢谢
- Happy birthday, dad! - Oh, thank you.

472
00:17:34,498 --> 00:17:35,630
好孩子
That's a boy.

473
00:17:35,630 --> 00:17:38,330
抱歉我们迟到了 但事出有因
Sorry we're late, but it's for a good reason.

474
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:41,390
我们考虑养只猫
We're thinking about getting a cat.

475
00:17:42,970 --> 00:17:44,670
那 真是太好了
Well, isn't that wonderful?

476
00:17:44,850 --> 00:17:47,590
我为你们感到激动 这是个重大决定
I'm thrilled for you both. This is a heck of a decision.

477
00:17:47,590 --> 00:17:49,590
我完全支持
You have my full support.

478
00:17:52,090 --> 00:17:52,490
好的
Okay.

479
00:17:52,630 --> 00:17:54,670
家里再添位成员真是太好了
I think it'll be a perfect addition to the family.

480
00:17:54,670 --> 00:17:57,030
我知道我自己会爱死那小家伙的
I know I'll love the heck out of the little bugger.

481
00:17:57,030 --> 00:17:59,150
我只希望那边的小家伙不要吃醋
I'm just hoping that little one over there doesn't get jealous.

482
00:17:59,330 --> 00:18:01,050
噢 "这个小家伙"不会有事的
Oh, this little one will be just fine

483
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:02,510
现在他知道自己在家是个啥地位了
now that he knows where he stands--

484
00:18:02,650 --> 00:18:04,090
活在你新宝贝的阴影下
In the shadow of your new baby!

485
00:18:04,210 --> 00:18:05,090
他说什么呢
What's he talking about?

486
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:07,690
他说的是我怀孕的事
He's talking about I am pregnant.

487
00:18:08,050 --> 00:18:09,690
-拜托 -怀孕
- Oh, come on! - Pregnant?!

488
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:10,810
你开玩笑吧
You gotta be kidding me!

489
00:18:10,850 --> 00:18:13,090
恶心 我没想到外公还能做
Oh, gross. I didn't know grandpa could still do it.

490
00:18:13,170 --> 00:18:14,670
别这么无礼 卢克
Don't be disrespectful, Luke.

491
00:18:14,750 --> 00:18:16,130
面对歌洛莉亚 谁都能硬起来
Anyone could do it with Gloria.

492
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:19,790
如果你习惯了一成不变的生活 不乐意接受
And if you're too set in your old ways to be happy about it,

493
00:18:20,010 --> 00:18:21,510
我可以一个人养大这孩子
I can raise it on my own.

494
00:18:21,630 --> 00:18:23,670
我以前养过 现在也可以做到
I have done it before, and I can do it now!

495
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:26,970
我和众多久经考验的坚强拉美女性一样
I come from a very long line of strong Latin women

496
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:29,730
习惯了不见老公的鬼影
whose husbands are nowhere to be found!

497
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:33,230
-你说完了吗 -是的
- Are you done? - Yes!

498
00:18:33,530 --> 00:18:35,130
-我能发表意见吗 -请说
- Can I say something? - Go on!

499
00:18:36,090 --> 00:18:38,590
这是我这辈子听到的最棒的消息
That's the greatest news I've ever heard.

500
00:18:39,490 --> 00:18:40,230
是吗
It is?

501
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:43,850
我一整天都在听我的未来依然光明的鬼话
I spent the day hearing what my future had in store for me,

502
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:45,950
没一句我爱听的
and I didn't like one bit of it.

503
00:18:46,090 --> 00:18:47,430
感觉像我的人生已经到头了
It felt like my life was ending.

504
00:18:48,230 --> 00:18:50,810
现在你告诉我 我能有个全新的开始
And now you're telling me that I get to have a new start...

505
00:18:52,170 --> 00:18:53,550
和我心爱的女人一起
with the woman of my dreams.

506
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:56,870
我觉得我快哭了
I think I'm gonna cry.

507
00:18:57,570 --> 00:18:58,430
我早哭了
I'm way ahead of you.

508
00:18:58,730 --> 00:18:59,550
你能相信吗
Can you believe this?

509
00:18:59,590 --> 00:19:01,550
就是说啊 人家连猫都不让我们养
I know. They wouldn't even let us get a cat.

510
00:19:02,250 --> 00:19:03,230
真是太好了
It's gonna be great!

511
00:19:03,690 --> 00:19:05,390
我会变成大肥婆
I'm gonna get so fat.

512
00:19:05,490 --> 00:19:06,470
大部分都挺好[除了变胖]
Mostly great.

513
00:19:09,890 --> 00:19:15,270
恶心 他们又来了
Oh, gross. They're at it again.

514
00:19:15,450 --> 00:19:16,810
你不喜欢就别看
If you don't like it, don't look.

515
00:19:18,430 --> 00:19:19,610
她看起来不错啊 是吧
She looks great, doesn't she?

516
00:19:19,910 --> 00:19:20,430
是啊
Yeah.

517
00:19:20,951 --> 00:19:23,890
我一直腹黑地希望她增肥 没想到是增在肚子上
Not really gaining weight the way I would've expected.

518
00:19:23,890 --> 00:19:26,250
我终于明白了为何大家都说孕妇光彩照人
I finally understand why people say pregnant women glow.

519
00:19:26,770 --> 00:19:28,632
菲尔 我怀过三次
Phil, I have had three children.

520
00:19:28,990 --> 00:19:31,190
爸 歌洛莉亚 拆我们的礼物吧
Hey, dad, Gloria, open our present.

521
00:19:31,190 --> 00:19:34,670
希望是高级货
Ooh! I hope it's something fancy.

522
00:19:34,670 --> 00:19:37,630
是给宝宝的 我好喜欢
It's for the baby. I love it!

523
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:40,870
我们在希思罗机场买的 免税
We got it in a shop at Heathrow, duty free.

524
00:19:41,530 --> 00:19:43,210
很快就不能"免屎"了
Not for long.

525
00:19:43,830 --> 00:19:44,970
是不是好棒的说
Isn't it absolutely brilliant?

526
00:19:45,090 --> 00:19:46,290
我们在伦敦就待了两周
Okay, we were in london two weeks.

527
00:19:46,301 --> 00:19:47,590
别拽口音了 麦当娜
Lose the accent, Madonna.

528
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:48,990
你的脸上怎么全是抓痕
Why is your face all scratched up?

529
00:19:49,450 --> 00:19:50,230
白痴拉里干的好事
Stupid Larry.

530
00:19:50,530 --> 00:19:51,790
感觉好怪
This feels so weird.

531
00:19:52,090 --> 00:19:52,950
很适合你
It suits you.

532
00:19:53,430 --> 00:19:55,330
别开没营养的玩笑
Don't even joke about it.

533
00:19:55,930 --> 00:19:58,110
够了 他明天就得给我搬
That's it. He is moving out of the house tomorrow.

534
00:19:58,590 --> 00:19:58,970
真的吗
Really?

535
00:19:58,981 --> 00:20:00,657
你的胡子也得刮
Oh, and that beard is going.

536
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:03,909
好吧 但小短可得伤心死了
Fine, but it's gonna kill shorty.

537
00:20:04,730 --> 00:20:06,850
好了各位 都过来吧
Okay, everybody, let's gather together.

538
00:20:07,410 --> 00:20:09,110
曼尼将为大家读一段
Manny's gonna read us a little something

539
00:20:09,110 --> 00:20:11,890
他在诗歌夏令营中做的诗
that he prepare in his poetry camp.

540
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:12,310
多谢 妈
Thank you, mom.

541
00:20:12,950 --> 00:20:15,110
谨以此诗献给我即将到来的弟弟或妹妹
This is for my new baby brother or sister.

542
00:20:16,850 --> 00:20:18,110
欢迎你 小家伙
"Welcome, little one.

543
00:20:18,470 --> 00:20:19,930
张开双眼 融入这个家吧
Open your eyes and take your place.

544
00:20:20,630 --> 00:20:21,870
这里是你命中注定的归宿
This is where you're meant to be,

545
00:20:22,170 --> 00:20:23,670
依偎在母亲的胸前
Nestled in the bosom of your mother."

546
00:20:24,110 --> 00:20:24,790
真幸运的宝宝
Lucky baby.

547
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:26,862
-什么 -爱你 宝贝
- What? - Love you, baby.

548
00:20:27,610 --> 00:20:29,250
这里是你命中注定的归宿
"This is where you're meant to be,

549
00:20:29,250 --> 00:20:30,490
父亲的怀抱
in the arms of your father.

550
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:34,090
他的漫长人生造就了今日的他
His long, long journey has readied him for this day,

551
00:20:34,390 --> 00:20:35,870
尽管他的皮肤也许松弛了
though his skin may be loose,

552
00:20:35,870 --> 00:20:37,330
他的头发已稀疏
his hair but a wisp,

553
00:20:37,530 --> 00:20:39,350
岁月的沉淀让他的眼神混浊不清
and his eyes milky with age,"

554
00:20:39,430 --> 00:20:40,310
好了 就念到这里吧
All right, we're done here.

555
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:42,290
得去喝一杯
Get a drink.

556
00:20:47,010 --> 00:20:49,430
别为你赶我走的事心怀愧疚 邓太太
Don't feel bad about making move out, mrs. D.

557
00:20:49,610 --> 00:20:51,250
我知道这一天终会到来
I knew this day would come eventually,

558
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:52,270
我有心理准备
and I'm totally covered.

559
00:20:52,670 --> 00:20:54,150
太好了 那我们回见了
Great. So we'll see you around.

560
00:20:54,290 --> 00:20:56,070
我有个老朋友那里有地方
I got a place with an old friend of mine.

561
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:59,130
与其说地方 不如说是储物间
Well, not so much of a place as a storage pod.

562
00:20:59,421 --> 00:21:02,570
与其说是朋友 不如说是浣熊
And not so much of a... friend as a raccoon.

563
00:21:02,570 --> 00:21:03,670
你有室友我很开心
Good to know you'll have company.

564
00:21:04,170 --> 00:21:06,750
我叫它小泡 因为它的嘴里全是泡沫
I call him bubbles because his mouth is all foamy.

565
00:21:06,750 --> 00:21:08,969
迪兰 你的小把戏我早看穿了
Dylan, I'm on to your little game.

566
00:21:08,969 --> 00:21:10,197
我知道你说的全是假的
I know non of this is ture.

567
00:21:10,197 --> 00:21:12,459
你就是想我内疚 然后让你留下来
You just try to guilt me into I letting you stay.

568
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:14,030
你说的对 对不起
You're right, I'm sorry.

569
00:21:14,770 --> 00:21:15,930
我住车上好了
I'll just live in my car.

570
00:21:16,910 --> 00:21:18,170
我可以借个衣架吗
Think I can borrow a coat hanger

571
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:20,100
我怕又被关在车里了
in case I get lock in there again.

572
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:21,669
-老天 -什么事啊
- God. - What's going on?

573
00:21:22,770 --> 00:21:24,630
不行 全刮掉
No, no no. All of it.

574
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:27,330
你不想在我恢复天使面容前与魔鬼共舞吗
Sure you don't wanna dance with the devil before I get rid of it.

575
00:21:27,330 --> 00:21:27,490
快去
Go.

576
00:21:28,610 --> 00:21:28,970
好吧
Fine.
